                "For GitHub, choose a file link rather than a repository folder, issue or sign-in page. For other sites, use the Raw or download link if the address is a web page instead of Markdown text. A local server must already be running on this computer; other private network addresses and sign-in-only links are not supported. Directly referenced supported pictures and files are downloaded with the Markdown. Open uses the managed cache; Download and Open chooses where to keep a portable copy. Review any asset failures before relying on offline access.",
