                 new("Keep a local copy if you want", "Read it in Reading or Split, or edit the writing pane. Choose File → Save As… and a local folder when you want to keep it.", "Only the local copy is saved, using the chosen encoding and line endings. Tern does not upload your edits back to the URL. The active URL draft shows Online; after Save As it is a local file."),
